  "intent": "Someone sings along into a handheld microphone. Light: the microphone rocks back on the beat in the singer's hand and swings forward again, a sound arc flicks off its head and fades, and the music note beside it springs up and lands on the beat, its flag whipping out. Strong: two beats: the microphone rocks twice, the note hops twice, the second higher, and an arc flicks out on each beat.",
